# Ad-hoc subprocesses, expanded and collapsed, with an ordering constraint.
# covers: §4.2, §4.5, §8, §8.2
title "Bid preparation"

start Invitation to tender
sub Prepare proposal [adhoc]
  task Research customer
  task Draft sections
  task Gather quotes
  task Check the budget
  task Review wording -> task Publish draft
sub Collect references [adhoc, sequential, collapsed]
  task Ask past customers
  task Write case studies
user Sign the bid
end Bid submitted
